{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --accent:#6a5cff;
      --accent-2:#ff7ab6;
      --muted:#6b7280;
      --bg:#fffdfb;
      --card:#fff;
      --radius:14px;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfbff 0%, #fffaf6 100%);margin:0;color:#111}
    .site{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    header{background:var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') center/cover no-repeat;padding:28px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.04)}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a.active{color:var(--accent)}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(18,18,24,0.04)}
    .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Mood selector */
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
    .mood{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff);border:1px solid rgba(90,90,120,0.06);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#222}
    .mood[data-selected="true"]{outline:3px solid rgba(106,92,255,0.12);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(106,92,255,0.08)}

    /* Right column */
    .contact-card{position:sticky;top:28px}
    form .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.06);font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .cta{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    /* Aroma wheel */
    .wheel-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    .wheel{width:100%;max-width:560px;height:420px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff9);border-radius:16px;padding:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}
    .note-info{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.04)}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .pill{background:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.04);font-weight:700}
    .faq{margin-top:18px}
    .faq h3{margin:8px 0}
    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    @media(max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .contact-card{position:relative;top:0}
      .wheel{height:320px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div class="nav">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="logo">A</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="blends.html">Signature Blends</a>
          <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Memberships</a>
          <a href="about.html">About</a>
          <a href="book.html">Book</a>
          <a class="active" href="contact.html">Connect</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="panel hero" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <div>
          <h1 id="contact-heading">Tell us what you need right now</h1>
          <p class="lead">Choose how you feel and we’ll suggest a way forward with scent. The recommendations may support relaxation, focus, or gentle uplift—not medical treatment.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <div class="meta">
              <div class="pill">Membership: Ongoing care</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-left:8px">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:14px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">How are you right now?</div>
            <div class="moods" role="list" aria-label="Mood selector">
              <button class="mood" data-mood="calm" aria-pressed="false">Calm</button>
              <button class="mood" data-mood="focused" aria-pressed="false">Focused</button>
              <button class="mood" data-mood="anxious" aria-pressed="false">Anxious</button>
              <button class="mood" data-mood="sleepy" aria-pressed="false">Sleepy</button>
              <button class="mood" data-mood="energized" aria-pressed="false">Energized</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Recommended approach</div>
              <div id="method-title" style="font-size:15px;margin-top:6px">Select a mood to see a method</div>
              <div id="method-desc" style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We highlight safe practices and a suggested format. You can ask for a customized plan when you connect.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="cta" id="primary-cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px">
          <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">A quick note on safety</div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Always patch-test new blends, dilute essential oils appropriately, and tell us about pregnancy, nursing, medications, or pets so we can recommend safe options. Our guidance may support wellbeing but is not a substitute for medical advice.</div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class="contact-card panel" aria-labelledby="form-heading">
        <h2 id="form-heading" style="margin-top:0">Connect & Request</h2>
        <form id="contact-form" method="post" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">
          <div class="row">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First & last" required>
            </div>
            <div style="width:130px">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <label for="intent">Quick preference</label>
            <select id="intent" name="intent">
              <option value="one-off">One-time session</option>
              <option value="membership">Membership planning</option>
              <option value="blend">Order a blend</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <label for="message">How can we help?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us a brief sense of what you’d like"></textarea>
          </div>

          <input type="hidden" id="selected-mood" name="selected_mood">
          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button type="submit" class="cta" id="submit-cta">Send request</button>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">We aim to reply within 2 business days.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq" style="margin-top:14px">
            <h3 style="margin:0">Common safety steps</h3>
            <ul style="color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0 18px">
              <li>Always dilute essential oils; follow recommended ratios and store safely.</li>
              <li>Perform a patch test on skin before regular topical use.</li>
              <li>Inform us about pregnancy, nursing, medications, or medical conditions.</li>
              <li>We provide pet-safe alternatives on request; some oils are toxic to animals.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </form>
      </aside>

      <section class="panel wheel-wrap" aria-labelledby="wheel-heading">
        <h2 id="wheel-heading">Aroma wheel: notes & roles</h2>
        <div class="wheel" id="aroma-wheel" role="application" aria-label="Aroma wheel">
          <!-- SVG wheel with interactive sectors -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 420" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false" role="img">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="1"></stop>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f7f3ff" stop-opacity="1"></stop>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="588" height="408" rx="12" fill="url(#g1)" stroke="rgba(17,17,17,0.03)"/>

            <!-- center labels -->
            <g transform="translate(300,210)">
              <circle r="72" fill="#fff" stroke="rgba(17,17,17,0.04)"></circle>
              <text x="0" y="-8" text-anchor="middle" style="font-weight:800;fill:#222;font-size:18px">Aroma map</text>
              <text id="wheel-role" x="0" y="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Hover a note</text>
            </g>

            <!-- Top notes (small, quick) -->
            <g id="top-notes" transform="translate(300,210)">
              <path class="sector" data-note="Bergamot" data-desc="Bright citrus that lifts the mood; often used near the nose." d="M0,-72 L120,-180 A200,200 0 0,0 -120,-180 Z" fill="#ffefc7" stroke="#f2d7a0"></path>
              <path class="sector" data-note="Grapefruit" data-desc="A tart, energizing top note that adds clarity to blends." d="M0,-72 L120,-180 A200,200 0 0,1 120,-180 Z" transform="rotate(30)" fill="#fff1f7" stroke="#ffd0e5"></path>
              <path class="sector" data-note="Peppermint" data-desc="Crisp menthol note for alertness; use diluted and sparingly." d="M0,-72 L60,-220 A230,230 0 0,0 -60,-220 Z" transform="rotate(-30)" fill="#e9fff9" stroke="#bfeee0"></path>
            </g>

            <!-- Middle notes -->
            <g id="middle-notes" transform="translate(300,210)">
              <path class="sector" data-note="Lavender" data-desc="Soothing floral with balancing qualities; versatile in many formulas." d="M0,-72 L180,0 A220,220 0 0,0 -180,0 Z" fill="#f7f2ff" stroke="#e6dffb" transform="rotate(30)"></path>
              <path class="sector" data-note="Rosemary" data-desc="Herbaceous, clearing aroma often used for a focused environment." d="M0,-72 L180,0 A220,220 0 0,1 180,0 Z" transform="rotate(-10)" fill="#f0fff7" stroke="#d8f5e7"></path>
            </g>

            <!-- Base notes -->
            <g id="base-notes" transform="translate(300,210)">
              <path class="sector" data-note="Cedarwood" data-desc="Warm, grounding base that helps anchors blends over time." d="M0,72 L-140,220 A260,260 0 0,0 140,220 Z" fill="#fff6ee" stroke="#f0d7be"></path>
              <path class="sector" data-note="Vanilla" data-desc="Soft, sweet base note that adds comfort; often used in very small amounts." d="M0,72 L-140,220 A260,260 0 0,1 -140,220 Z" transform="rotate(20)" fill="#fff6f5" stroke="#f2d7e5"></path>
            </g>

          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="note-info" id="note-panel" aria-live="polite">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:800" id="note-name">Hover a note</div>
              <div id="note-desc" style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Top = quick, Middle = character, Base = lingering</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);">Role</div>
              <div id="note-role" style="font-weight:700">--</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted)">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — Confidential consultations and membership options. <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method mapping
    const methods = {
      calm: {title: 'Mini grounding inhale', desc: 'A focused 3-breath micropractice with a gentle floral-citrus inhalation. Suggest: diffuse lightly or do a single inhalation near the nose. May support a sense of calm.', cta: 'Try Calm Micropractice', ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#calm'},
      focused: {title: 'Focus roll-on', desc: 'A small roll-on with herbaceous top notes for desk clarity. Apply to wrists or temples after dilution. May support attention in short bursts.', cta: 'Get Focus Roll-on', ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#focus'},
      anxious: {title: 'Soothing evening protocol', desc: 'A diffuse-and-breath routine with calming middle notes to aid winding down. Use a low diffusion setting and keep windows open for circulation. May support relaxation.', cta: 'Start Soothing Routine', ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#soothe'},
      sleepy: {title: 'Gentle sleep blend', desc: 'A bedside diffuser plan emphasizing warm base notes and low volume. Keep essential oils away from bedding and pets. May support restful transitions.', cta: 'Preview Sleep Blend', ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#sleep'},
      energized: {title: 'Uplift spritz', desc: 'A light spritzable mist with bright top notes to refresh movement or morning routines. Shake before use and patch-test first. May support a quick uplift.', cta: 'Make Uplift Spritz', ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#energize'}
    };

    // Mood selector handling
    const moodButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
    const methodTitle = document.getElementById('method-title');
    const methodDesc = document.getElementById('method-desc');
    const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');
    const selectedMoodInput = document.getElementById('selected-mood');
    const submitCta = document.getElementById('submit-cta');

    moodButtons.forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        moodButtons.forEach(b=>{b.dataset.selected='false';b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});
        btn.dataset.selected='true';btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');
        const mood = btn.dataset.mood;
        selectedMoodInput.value = mood;
        const m = methods[mood] || {};
        methodTitle.textContent = m.title || 'Select a mood to see a method';
        methodDesc.textContent = m.desc || '';
        primaryCta.textContent = m.cta || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
        primaryCta.href = m.ctaUrl || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
        submitCta.textContent = 'Send request: ' + (m.cta || 'Request');
        highlightNotesForMood(mood);
      });

      // keyboard accessibility
      btn.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' ') { e.preventDefault(); btn.click(); }});
    });

    // Aroma wheel interactions
    const sectors = document.querySelectorAll('.sector');
    const noteName = document.getElementById('note-name');
    const noteDesc = document.getElementById('note-desc');
    const noteRole = document.getElementById('note-role');
    const wheelRole = document.getElementById('wheel-role');

    sectors.forEach(s=>{
      s.style.cursor='pointer';
      s.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=>{
        const name = s.dataset.note || 'Note';
        const desc = s.dataset.desc || '';
        noteName.textContent = name;
        noteDesc.textContent = desc;
        // determine role by parent group id
        let role = 'Middle';
        let p = s.parentNode;
        while(p && p.id!==undefined){ if(p.id==='top-notes') role='Top'; if(p.id==='middle-notes') role='Middle'; if(p.id==='base-notes') role='Base'; p = p.parentNode; }
        noteRole.textContent = role;
        wheelRole.textContent = role + ' note';
        s.setAttribute('fill-opacity','0.9');
      });
      s.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=>{
        noteName.textContent = 'Hover a note';
        noteDesc.textContent = 'Top = quick, Middle = character, Base = lingering';
        noteRole.textContent = '--';
        wheelRole.textContent = 'Hover a note';
        s.removeAttribute('fill-opacity');
      });
      // click to add to message quick snippet
      s.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const formMsg = document.getElementById('message');
        const snippet = '[' + s.dataset.note + '] ' + s.dataset.desc;
        formMsg.value = (formMsg.value?formMsg.value + '\n' : '') + snippet;
      });
    });

    // Highlight notes when mood selected (simple mapping)
    function highlightNotesForMood(mood){
      // reset styles
      sectors.forEach(s=>{ s.style.filter='none'; s.style.opacity='0.95'; });
      const map = {
        calm:['Lavender','Cedarwood','Vanilla'],
        focused:['Peppermint','Rosemary','Bergamot'],
        anxious:['Lavender','Bergamot','Cedarwood'],
        sleepy:['Vanilla','Lavender','Cedarwood'],
        energized:['Grapefruit','Peppermint','Bergamot']
      };
      const list = map[mood] || [];
      sectors.forEach(s=>{
        if(list.includes(s.dataset.note)){
          s.style.filter='drop-shadow(0 6px 18px rgba(106,92,255,0.12))';
          s.style.opacity='1';
        } else {
          s.style.opacity='0.52';
        }
      });
    }

    // Progressive enhancement: set initial selected mood if provided
    (function(){
      const initial = document.querySelector('.mood[data-selected="true"]');
      if(initial) initial.click();
    })();

    // Simple form handler stub
    document.getElementById('contact-form').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      // Allow actual submit in production; here just prevent for demo
      // e.preventDefault();
      // alert('Form submitted (demo)');
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — aromatherapy-MORE-2026-02-17T15-44-59-177Z-031

This chunk contains two files for the contact/connection experience of the aromatherapy membership site.

Files included:
- contact.html — the full contact page with interactive features
- README.md — this file

Features in contact.html:
- Mood-to-Method selector: choose a current mood (Calm, Focused, Anxious, Sleepy, Energized). The page updates a recommended method, updates the primary CTA label and URL, and fills a hidden field in the contact form.
- Aroma wheel: interactive SVG wheel with top / middle / base notes. Hovering a sector shows the note name, description, and role. Clicking a sector inserts a short snippet into the message textarea.
- Accessibility: keyboard-press activation for mood buttons, ARIA labels for navigation and the wheel, and an aria-live region for the note panel.
- Safety-forward FAQ: includes patch-test, dilution, pregnancy, pets guidance. Language avoids medical claims and uses "may support" phrasing.

Placeholders to replace in the template (do not remove):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Customization notes:
- The CTA updates use anchors like "{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#calm"; replace or adapt as needed for routing.
- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} by default. Replace with your form handler if needed.
- The CSS references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for the header background. Ensure that asset exists in your build (unique pattern required for this project).

Testing locally:
1. Open contact.html in a browser.
2. Click a mood button to see method text, CTA label and URL update, and the form hidden field set.
3. Hover sectors on the aroma wheel to view note details. Click a sector to append a note snippet into the message field.

Safety and content guidelines:
- Copy avoids direct therapeutic or medical promises. All claims use permissive language such as "may support".
- The FAQ and form encourage disclosure of pregnancy, medications, and pets so practitioners can provide safe alternatives.

Developer notes:
- No external libraries are used; all JS and CSS are inline.
- The layout is responsive and will stack columns on narrow viewports.

If you need an alternate nav label set, different program names, or updated copy tone, edit the header nav and content sections in contact.html accordingly."}
